OL,3,GNEWSAMP urges action over future of
OL,4,AIneos jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has called on the government to
OL,7,Ftake urgent action to secure the future
OL,8,Fof jobs at a chemical park in Hull.
OL,10,FIt comes after industrial giant Ineos
OL,11,Fannounced in September it was pausing
OL,12,Fproduction at its three plants at
OL,13,FSaltend Chemicals Park, blaming high UK
OL,14,Fgas prices.
OL,16,FBeverley and Holderness MP Graham
OL,17,FStuart said he had met with Industry
OL,18,FMinister Blair McDougall to discuss the
OL,19,Ffuture of the plants and called for a
OL,20,F"resolution before Christmas" because
OL,21,F"skilled jobs depend on it".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
