OL,3,GNEWSAMP urges action over future of
OL,4,AIneos jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Business and Trade
OL,7,F(DfBT) said the government had "already
OL,8,Ftaken bold action to support our
OL,9,Fchemicals industry".
